From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 16:25:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add Cmd+Z to undo the last file operation (move, copy,
 rename, new folder, delete, recycle restore) by running its reverse through
 the netdisk client from an in-memory per-session stack, since a mistaken file
 action otherwise has no way back.

